{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BYONG Bring your own non-gamer and explore a one-of-a-kind embroidered metroidvania world in split-screen, local couch co-op, with a companion. This gem is perfect for players who\u2019d like to introduce someone who doesn't play video games to the hobby. You play as a snail visiting a plant park, identifying plants you\u2019ve never seen before. Customize your shell by finding unique designs in the world. Uncover mysteries and get safely lost in this peaceful world, as there are no enemies or combat to worry about. Only you, your companion, and the surrounding environment.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3448390?t=1759390586","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448390/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759390586","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448390/0170bda4d1a4a9d5e06ea637aaee3512fb56f0d5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759390586","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448390/0170bda4d1a4a9d5e06ea637aaee3512fb56f0d5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759390586","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3487960,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi all! We just put out the new demo for Embroideryvania, incorporating all the feedback we've received thus far. Make sure you follow us to stay up to date.\u00a0</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BYONG Bring your own non-gamer and explore a one-of-a-kind embroidered metroidvania world in split-screen, local couch co-op, with a companion. This gem is perfect for players who\u2019d like to introduce someone who doesn't play video games to the hobby. You play as a snail visiting a plant park, identifying plants you\u2019ve never seen before. Customize your shell by finding unique designs in the world. Uncover mysteries and get safely lost in this peaceful world, as there are no enemies or combat to worry about. Only you, your companion, and the surrounding environment.\u00a0</p>","developers":["No Sequels Cooperative"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448390/header.jpg?t=1759390586","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3448390/1416629401/94341cfb0ca4ce512e395d13861335436397785b/1754000925/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754001892","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3448390/1416629401/94341cfb0ca4ce512e395d13861335436397785b/1754000925/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754001892","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3448390/1416629401/94341cfb0ca4ce512e395d13861335436397785b/1754000925/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754001892","id":257176470,"name":"Embroideryvania BYONG Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257176470/80dc60a30d9aff8e02cd3c8f68a0869b80d5b72e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754001892"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3448390/814827/03acdfb94927ee0ac528fb49922d4e441046eafb/1750852149/dash_av1.mpd?t=1739172653","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3448390/814827/03acdfb94927ee0ac528fb49922d4e441046eafb/1750852149/dash_h264.mpd?t=1739172653","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/34